---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Karmatix Learning"
  description="Privacy Policy for Karmatix Learning. We collect zero personal data, execute no tracking scripts, and store progress locally."
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <article class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      
      <!-- Notice Header -->
      <div class="mb-8 p-4 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 text-xs font-mono">
        NOTICE: Review with legal counsel before launch.
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#f8fafc] tracking-tight mb-4">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#64748b] mb-8 font-mono">
        Last updated: November 7, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="prose prose-invert text-sm sm:text-base text-[#94a3b8] space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
        
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f8fafc] mb-2">1. Our Core Privacy Commitment</h2>
          <p>
            Karmatix Learning is published by Karmatix (karmatix.in). We believe education should be private, accessible, and free of surveillance. We do not require registration, do not collect personal identities, and do not monetize your browsing behaviour.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f8fafc] mb-2">2. Alignment with India's DPDP Act Principles</h2>
          <p>
            In accordance with the principles of India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
            <li><strong>No Unauthorized Data Collection:</strong> We do not collect, process, or store your personal identifiers such as name, email address, phone number, or biometric data on any remote server.</li>
            <li><strong>Zero Third-Party Trackers:</strong> We do not load Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, advertising scripts, or third-party telemetry beacons.</li>
            <li><strong>Purpose Limitation:</strong> We only process data necessary to render static educational content in your local web browser.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f8fafc] mb-2">3. Local Browser Storage</h2>
          <p>
            When you complete quizzes, track module progress, or customize study schedules in our courses, that information is saved directly in your browser's <code>localStorage</code>. This data never leaves your device and is not transmitted to Karmatix or any external party. You can wipe this data at any time by clearing your browser cache.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f8fafc] mb-2">4. Hosting and Server Logs</h2>
          <p>
            This website is hosted statically via GitHub Pages. Like all web servers, GitHub may log basic connection metadata (such as IP addresses and request timestamps) to maintain server security and prevent denial of service attacks. We do not sell or analyze these connection logs.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f8fafc] mb-2">5. Contact and Grievances</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions regarding this policy or data practices at Karmatix, you can contact us at:
          </p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[#60a5fa] mt-2">
            contact@karmatix.in
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

    </div>
  </article>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>
